Frequent comment from my wife:  "Are you still playing that same
game?"

Months later I finally ascended.

First thing new in this game was I used price iding.  Before I just
looked for identify scrolls.

Early on I got a cloak of displacement and it was fun.

Sacrificed a couple of humans by accident.  That was a pain.

First major break was I killed a Gecko and it had a magic marker.

Got magicbane, used for Elbereth writing.

Then I got a wish off a smokey potion and got GDSM.

Got rid of h's and eventually ;'s and L's.

Easily did quest and the Fort.

Cleared out the castle.  

I decided to be cautious and wear amulet of life saving and just wield
+7 MJ.

If I had SDSM and cloak of magic resistence then I could have
two-weaponed with silver spear, but I just decided to go with what I
had.

My biggest problem after this was on Orcus' level.  
I didn't do it right.  
I ended up surrounded by Orcus, Yee..., and Demogoron.  
I was ill and stunned.  I did some quick spoiler reading.  
Even so, it took me a while to realize I couldn't write Elbereth while
stunned.
I got un-stunned, un-ill, elberethed and wished for a cockatrice 
corpse and stoned all three.

After that I cleared out the monsters to the bottom, 
found the square, killed WOY got book, cleared out the sanctum 
without incident.  I used several wand 
of death charges - probably ten -- mostly on the wizard.

Then on astral plane I used ring of conflict and teleported a lot of
monsters out of my way.

Basically I took a very long time and accumulated a ton of items.

